  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated food security, nutrition, health, WASH and livelihoods response to the drought in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO will provide rapid support to the most vulnerable rural households to help them make it through the harsh dry months of Jilaal until the next rains in April. With funding from DFID, FAO will respond to time-sensitive needs in drought-affected areas of southern Somalia</narrative>
  </description>
